Package: amberedit
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: FidoNet mail editor for the terminal
 AmberEdit reads and writes Squish, JAM and Fido *.msg message bases on top of
 an existing tosser configuration, which it reads from a fidoconfig, an
 areas.bbs or a squish.cfg rather than duplicating.
 .
 It is a reader and an editor, not a mailer and not a tosser: what it writes
 goes out only when a tosser carries it. Both UTF-8 and the legacy single-byte
 encodings FidoNet still runs on — CP866, CP437 and the rest — are read and
 written, and nodelists, pointlists and echolists are compiled and searched.
